flowchart TB
  subgraph F001["F-001 Continuous ingestion (CAP-001; FR-001 to FR-011; ADR-004, ADR-006)"]
    direction LR
    A[Start or reconnection] --> B[Request instruments of both platforms over REST]
    B --> C[Pair by asset; list unpaired]
    C --> D[Recover funding history of each pair]
    D --> E[Subscribe to the order book channels]
    E --> F[Resync each order book over REST]
    F --> G{Did a minute close?}
    G -- yes, valid book --> H[Store book snapshot]
    G -- yes, no valid book --> I[Record final gap for the minute]
    H --> G
    I --> G
    G -- every minute --> P1[Request mark and index price of all instruments: one request per platform]
    P1 -- arrived --> P2[Store price readings]
    P1 -- did not arrive --> P3[Record price gap for the minute]
    E -. disconnection .-> J[Open gap and reconnect]
    J --> A
    K[Every hour] --> L[Request funding paid over REST]
    L -- arrived --> M[Store funding reading]
    L -- did not arrive --> N[Open funding gap]
    N -. on reconnect .-> D
  end

  subgraph F002["F-002 Hour t of E1 on paper (CAP-003; FR-019 to FR-026; BR-004)"]
    direction LR
    P[Hour t, after storing the funding of t] --> X[Accrual: credit or debit the funding of t only to legs opened before t]
    X --> Q[For each non-excluded pair: rates of hour t]
    Q -- one is missing --> R[Decision no_action; null spread]
    Q -- both present --> S[Funding spread]
    S --> T[Apply preregistration rules with data up to t]
    T --> U{Action}
    U -- open, close or reverse --> V[Walk the previous book snapshot for the reference size]
    V --> W[Record trade with price, fee and slippage; a leg opened at t collects from t+1]
    U -- hold --> Y[Every minute: basis and distance to liquidation]
    W --> Y
    Y -- crosses level --> Z[Leg liquidated; the other is left uncovered]
  end

  subgraph F003["F-003 Verdict (CAP-002; FR-015 to FR-018; BR-009; PD-020, PD-021)"]
    direction LR
    AA[Horizon is reached] --> AB[For each pair: gaps between its pairing and its delisting]
    AB -- exceeds PD-013 --> AH[Exclude the pair and report its gaps]
    AB -- does not exceed --> AI[The pair enters the verdict]
    AH --> AJ{Any pairs left?}
    AI --> AJ
    AJ -- no --> AC[Run not_qualifiable with its reason]
    AJ -- yes --> AD[Net profit with breakdown for the pairs that enter]
    AD --> AE[Annual return on the maximum collateral used at once]
    AE --> AF[Compare with the preregistered criterion]
    AF --> AG[Verdict with breakdown, excluded pairs and variants tested]
  end

  M --> P
